00:14:57,565 --> 00:14:59,669
[SPEAKER_05]: Those are the things that you were suffering in regard to.

150
00:14:59,689 --> 00:15:06,261
[SPEAKER_05]: So, why are you going in this completely different direction, that has nothing to do with it, to escape the...

