[SPEAKER_05]: The grounds and all this stuff, the entire thing, is the same thing, just feeling not being understood.

168
00:17:09,263 --> 00:17:23,052
[SPEAKER_05]: And actually, the Buddha said, somebody who understands the three feelings, understands the origin, gratification and... no, the gratification, danger and escape,

