00:18:11,732 --> 00:18:22,041
[SPEAKER_05]: That that passion is like, as Siddhartha would say, putting your head in a chopping block, as we discussed in one of the previous talks.

177
00:18:22,762 --> 00:18:24,944
[SPEAKER_05]: Then, you won't have to wish for the passion not to be there.

178
00:18:25,324 --> 00:18:31,350
[SPEAKER_05]: It will have to go, because the passion was based on you still regarding those things as

